        "ParentObjectID": "comfortablebedplaced",
        "LocalizationKey": "Comfort_ComfortableBed_Placed_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A proper bed: a down-stuffed mattress mounted on a copper-braced wooden frame. The best night's sleep you can build in the wild."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "comfortablebedplaced",
        "LocalizationKey": "Comfort_ComfortableBed_Placed_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Usage:</b> Nap or Sleep on it for the best rest available, and its warmth passively lifts perceived temperature while you're in this environment.\n\n<b>Take Apart:</b> Splits the bed back into its Down Mattress and Copper Bed Frame so you can move it to a new camp."
    },
